Hosts or connects to the deployment dashboard and durable agent API

Usage: leptoskit console <COMMAND>

Commands:
  serve              Serves the dashboard, durable jobs and analytics history for trusted repositories
  connect            Links this app to a service. Reads `LEPTOSKIT_CONTROL_KEY`; stores it outside the repository
  status             Reads projects and recent operations from the connected service
  worker             Runs a dedicated outbound worker paired with the hosted `LeptosKit` app
  token              Issues a project-scoped key; prints its value once. Store it as a secret
  backup             Makes a consistent local backup of the management database
  restore            Restores a verified management backup offline and revokes restored tokens
  rollback-database  Reverses the management schema offline, after making a new backup. Deletes its history
  help               Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
